n": "excluded", "reason": "Asosiy lavozim dasturchi yoki dizayner", "linked_hh_id": null}, {"id": "tg:unilance/7979", "url": "https://t.me/unilance/7979", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:08:43+00:00", "classification": "excluded", "reason": "Asosiy lavozim dasturchi yoki dizayner", "linked_hh_id": null}], "jobs": [{"id": "tg:unilance/7996", "url": "https://t.me/unilance/7996", "source": "telegram", "title": "QA Automation Engineer (C# / .NET)", "company": "Silver Star Soft LLC", "city": "Ташкент", "country": null, "area_id": null, "area_path": null, "address": null, "published_at": "2026-11-06T08:33:01+00:00", "valid_through": null, "experience": null, "grades": ["Unspecified"], "grade_source": "title", "directions": ["Automation"], "direction_source": "title", "work_format": null, "salary": null, "salary_text": "from $1000 / month", "compensation": {}, "employment_type": null, "work_format_codes": [], "archived": null, "description": "#junior\n#qa\n#automation\n#dotnet\nQA Automation Engineer (C# / .NET)\nWe are looking for a QA Automation Engineer to build automated testing for a large data platform. The system includes a Windows desktop application, a web portal, APIs, background services and SQL Server databases. You will automate testing across the whole system, from UI and API tests to full end-to-end scenarios that run in CI, with support from experienced developers.\nCompany: Silver Star Soft LLC\nRole: QA Automation Engineer\nSalary: from $1000 / month\nFormat: Hybrid (on-site + remote)\nWhat you will do\n• Build and maintain a test automation framework for the platform\n• Automate UI tests for the desktop application and the web portal\n• Write API and integration tests for REST/WCF services and background services\n• Create end-to-end tests that cover full business flows: UI → services → database\n• Prepare test data and check results directly in SQL Server\n• Run automated tests in GitHub Actions on every pull request\n• Use AI tools to speed up writing, maintaining and debugging tests\n• Report bugs in Jira and work closely with developers to get them fixed\nCore Requirements\n• 1+ year of experience in test automation, or C# development with a strong interest in QA\n• Good knowledge of C# / .NET and a test framework (NUnit or xUnit)\n• API testing experience (Postman, HttpClient/RestSharp)\n• Basic SQL skills: SELECT, JOIN, inserting and checking test data\n• Understanding of testing theory: test cases, test levels, bug life cycle\n• Hands-on experience with AI coding tools (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Cursor or similar)\n• Git basics\n• English B1+ for written communication and calls with the team\n• Availability for evening calls and meetings from 9 to 11 PM Tashkent time\nNice to Have\n• Desktop UI automation (FlaUI, WinAppDriver or Appium)\n• Experience with CI/CD pipelines in GitHub Actions\n• Docker and isolated test environments\n• Knowledge of WCF, Windows services or RabbitMQ\n• Performance / load testing (k6, JMeter, NBomber)\nWhat we offer\n• Hybrid format: office + remote\n• Work in an international team across different time zones\n• A chance to build test automation from scratch and grow into a senior QA engineer\n• Mentoring from an experienced development team\n• Real-world engineering projects\n• Friendly team\nSend your resume to\n@DilshodMakhmudov\n@unilance\n- the best for you", "description_html": "<div data-qa=\"vacancy-description\"><p>#junior</p><p>#qa</p><p>#automation</p><p>#dotnet</p><p>QA Automation Engineer (C# / .NET)</p><p>We are looking for a QA Automation Engineer to build automated testing for a large data platform. The system includes a Windows desktop application, a web portal, APIs, background services and SQL Server databases. You will automate testing across the whole system, from UI and API tests to full end-to-end scenarios that run in CI, with support from experienced developers.</p><p>Company: Silver Star Soft LLC</p><p>Role: QA Automation Engineer</p><p>Salary: from $1000 / month</p><p>Format: Hybrid (on-site + remote)</p><p>What you will do</p><p>• Build and maintain a test automation framework for the platform</p><p>• Automate UI tests for the desktop application and the web portal</p><p>• Write API and integration tests for REST/WCF services and background services</p><p>• Create end-to-end tests that cover full business flows: UI → services → database</p><p>• Prepare test data and check results directly in SQL Server</p><p>• Run automated tests in GitHub Actions on every pull request</p><p>• Use AI tools to speed up writing, maintaining and debugging tests</p><p>• Report bugs in Jira and work closely with developers to get them fixed</p><p>Core Requirements</p><p>• 1+ year of experience in test automation, or C# development with a strong interest in QA</p><p>• Good knowledge of C# / .NET and a test framework (NUnit or xUnit)</p><p>• API testing experience (Postman, HttpClient/RestSharp)</p><p>• Basic SQL skills: SELECT, JOIN, inserting and checking test data</p><p>• Understanding of testing theory: test cases, test levels, bug life cycle</p><p>• Hands-on experience with AI coding tools (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Cursor or similar)</p><p>• Git basics</p><p>• English B1+ for written communication and calls with the team</p><p>• Availability for evening calls and meetings from 9 to 11 PM Tashkent time</p><p>Nice to Have</p><p>• Desktop UI automation (FlaUI, WinAppDriver or Appium)</p><p>• Experience with CI/CD pipelines in GitHub Actions</p><p>• Docker and isolated test environments</p><p>• Knowledge of WCF, Windows services or RabbitMQ</p><p>• Performance / load testing (k6, JMeter, NBomber)</p><p>What we offer</p><p>• Hybrid format: office + remote</p><p>• Work in an international team across different time zones</p><p>• A chance to build test automation from scratch and grow into a senior QA engineer</p><p>• Mentoring from an experienced development team</p><p>• Real-world engineering projects</p><p>• Friendly team</p><p>Se